# From prism-notes, claude/04-domains-and-documents/evidence/hosting/14-generic-implementation-text-answer/tests.prism: attempt 14 of the Bible's document hosting against prismc at 10ca993, committed as written. A wrong program: the request tag's field has a type variable its output does not (Type System ch. 2: a variable in a field must appear in the index; a generic tag's output is a scheme, its variables shared with its fields).
# Attempt 14's test: an accepted request, then a refused one.
emit Ui.* | Seat.*
use App.*

test one_generic_implementation, @host:
    build
    click Ui.Button(label="add 2")
    compute
    compute
    compute
    click Ui.Button(label="add 9")
    compute
    compute
    compute
